{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19310ffa79bcde63be1fafb86a0b243ae886e2d69ce59a66015a62743b43e671",
      "text": "野外求生综艺的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c338fdee6f5c2809797b10cec358db774b07f9f83fe814dffec42f337e482e54",
      "text": "辛苦了。目前来看拍摄进行得很顺利，\n如果遇到什么难处，请随时告诉我哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de15b32c7a7d649668e6a76fb6b09e4971c1cd35a677a28080941bb15a90097b",
      "text": "啊，没事的。不如说，我现在反而涌起了一股就算真的要去野外求生也能乐在其中的自信呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cbf793bc4d8befe8708b3eec10dd7fdfde38933a8ce522afa9d51a3f834e157",
      "text": "在无人岛上过野外求生生活之类的，\n不觉得很有意思吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df8dc44c96cea88393a7b5f8388ad41bbcf15234d7fc1ea15174c8cbea8e06a9",
      "text": "啊哈哈……如果是英雄先生的话，感觉真的能乐在其中呢。\n顺便问一下，您更想一个人还是和谁一起去呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58758da9a394d04ace4968fb30bab6805fc0987832733b5c95c9a467595d31f8",
      "text": "嗯——……一个人倒也不坏，\n但既然要去，还是希望能和信玄还有龙一起啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f8fb681db3963fe47a6298de5d67ea2e44674b89492c5b50824e6da4f817033",
      "text": "果然还是想和同组合的两位一起呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3f41df5cc4635711c62a2694a81fe5850c24ad6e6ae1216912b270ad4a29b05",
      "text": "和知根知底的家伙在一起既放心，\n而且最重要的是，我们三个人的话绝对能过得很开心吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ffdfca57b8ba54f24bc64c3fa38067e34053ca86d65625b36fb9ce0d39c7a9f",
      "text": "信玄感觉比我更懂野外求生，\n而龙不管做什么事都特别拼命。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9caac6276734494aaad59fdbd428e26032cdbc1f9eace2a2fa257eefb500c175",
      "text": "原来如此。\n以后以FRAME为核心策划一个类似的节目好像也挺有趣的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c9a83709bb4a9486f6a3141dc4851e91b496d8c75d5828f950a45e301cbd2ce",
      "text": "真的吗？那今天我可得多学点求生技巧，\n为了那一天把本事练扎实才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
